(rectangle (start 203.2 35.56) (end 340.36 68.58) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 78f43258-198a-59b8-b9d4-1cdb024092b3))
(text "E3-08 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.2; §5.4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204.47 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9cf37bd2-45da-5421-9412-6ce5a85d61f1))
(text "Pico watchdog, MicroPython GPIO/UART adapter and host handshake implemented 20.10.2026 and tested on the host.\nActual GPIO timing, reset levels, WDT/brownout behavior and Linux/serial fault recovery have not been\nqualified on the device.\nВорота (стенд): Run the implemented firmware with the actual accepted Pico/Q6A assembly: scope MCP RESET\nassertion/release, safe output image including CHG_INHIBIT=1 after initialization, 100ms guard, 750ms\nheartbeat deadline plus measured latency, explicit fresh-session recovery, Linux kill/hang, UART\nloss/corruption, WDT/brownout and GPIO current/backfeed. Complete Pico power loss with Q6A alive remains\noutside Q306 coverage; no software test closes this boundary. GNSS branch (R-E3-15): measure the LC76G board\nsupply current on E3_GNSS5V (cold start, acquisition, active antenna) and set R396 to 1.5-2x the measured\ncurrent (start 162k, 144-192 mA); confirm U315 follows 3V3_Q6A (off with Q6A off) and record UART6_RX/TX\nlevels and LC76G VCC with LAB5 absent while Q6A runs and with U315 latched off after a short on E3_GNSS5V\n(S25) while Q6A runs (no back-feed through RXD above VCC + 0.3 V in either state); record which action clears\nthe latch (3V3_Q6A or LAB5 power cycle; whether a Q6A software reboot drops 3V3_Q6A)." (at 204.47 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid fac5adcb-a987-500f-8eb5-df459840445f))
(rectangle (start 203.2 71.12) (end 340.36 81.28) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 60 150 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid b125beed-992f-5fe6-8ba6-a77d4ccaa173))
(text "N-E3-02 — примітка — STACK §5.1 (правило RILIM); §8.1" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204.47 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid fdc1661f-3dbf-55d2-a859-b01611fd25f7))
(text "R396 = RILIM TBD (старт 162k 1%, 144–192 mA за рівняннями TI SLVS841G). STACK номіналу не задає, лише правило\nRILIM = 1.5–2× виміряного струму LC76G. Ворота: E3-08." (at 204.47 74.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 34d09369-3194-53eb-b290-5f1159bf76a7))
